1
00:01:38,519 --> 00:01:39,519
Let's head out together.

2
00:01:39,519 --> 00:01:41,159
I happen to be passing by Heping Street anyway.

3
00:01:41,519 --> 00:01:42,920
No need. You go ahead.

4
00:01:42,920 --> 00:01:45,640
A cab costs the same for one person anyway.

5
00:01:45,879 --> 00:01:46,840
Wherever you're going, I can drop you off.

6
00:01:47,159 --> 00:01:49,079
Thanks, but my boyfriend is coming to pick me up.

7
00:01:53,159 --> 00:01:54,640
Sir, need a ride?

8
00:01:54,879 --> 00:01:55,680
No, thank you.

9
00:01:56,560 --> 00:01:57,640
1.8 is too expensive.

10
00:01:57,640 --> 00:01:58,439
I'll wait for a 1.6 one.

11
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:02,400
This is...

12
00:02:06,519 --> 00:02:07,680
Boss Lin.

13
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:09,080
He lives next door to me.

14
00:02:09,080 --> 00:02:10,199
He's from Taiwan, China.

15
00:02:10,840 --> 00:02:11,599
Hello.

16
00:02:12,319 --> 00:02:13,479
A fine young man.

17
00:02:13,479 --> 00:02:14,080
How may I address you?

18
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:15,000
Huadong.

19
00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:16,759
Where do you work?

20
00:02:17,080 --> 00:02:18,800
Institute of Research on the Structure of Matter,
Academy of Sciences.

21
00:02:19,479 --> 00:02:20,560
Young and promising.

22
00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:22,639
A scientist. What do you research?

23
00:02:22,639 --> 00:02:23,360
Applied chemistry.

24
00:02:23,919 --> 00:02:24,840
Deep stuff.

25
00:02:25,759 --> 00:02:27,319
Lin Kanshan. Pleased to meet you.

26
00:02:30,759 --> 00:02:32,120
Boss Lin, we'll get going now.

27
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:32,599
Sure.

28
00:02:33,360 --> 00:02:34,159
See you.

29
00:02:35,120 --> 00:02:36,120
Let's grab a meal together sometime.

30
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:48,280
Is he still watching us?

31
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:50,240
Who knows?

32
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:52,280
He had a ride, but didn't leave,

33
00:02:52,280 --> 00:02:53,759
just to wait and see you.

34
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:55,520
Now that he has, he probably won't look anymore.

35
00:02:56,080 --> 00:02:58,599
Was I too serious just now?

36
00:02:59,719 --> 00:03:00,919
Just be yourself.

37
00:03:00,919 --> 00:03:01,759
However you normally are,

38
00:03:01,759 --> 00:03:02,840
act the exact same way now.

39
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,639
Don't change a thing, or you'll blow your cover.

40
00:03:04,639 --> 00:03:05,560
Did Ma Qi teach you that?

41
00:03:06,159 --> 00:03:07,759
Assigning you to play my boyfriend...

42
00:03:08,639 --> 00:03:10,319
does it mean the higher-ups don't trust him anymore?

43
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:11,479
What do you think?

44
00:03:22,080 --> 00:03:22,840
Morning, Brother Qi.

45
00:03:24,840 --> 00:03:26,520
Dragging your feet, slow at everything.

46
00:03:26,759 --> 00:03:27,800
The rabbit we were watching got away,

47
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:28,719
and you don't even know it.

48
00:03:29,919 --> 00:03:30,840
What rabbit?

49
00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:31,960
You don't even know what rabbit.

50
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:39,120
Chunxiao, don't sit down yet.

51
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:40,000
Head over to the auto mall.

52
00:03:40,479 --> 00:03:42,080
Why doesn't the new car have tinted windows?

53
00:03:42,080 --> 00:03:43,560
If you drive that to tail Lin Kanshan,

54
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:45,960
do you want him watching you pick your nose?

55
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:51,479
Check what car our compatriot from Taiwan, China chose.

56
00:03:51,479 --> 00:03:52,000
Yes, sir.

57
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:56,599
A close neighbor is better than a distant relative.

58
00:03:57,520 --> 00:03:58,360
What did Jinlan say?

59
00:03:58,360 --> 00:03:59,520
Regarding the new neighbor,

60
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:00,759
how did he react?

61
00:04:00,840 --> 00:04:01,639
Everything's normal so far.

62
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:06,800
Boss, have some water.

63
00:04:09,159 --> 00:04:10,159
Is that heavy?

64
00:04:10,159 --> 00:04:11,039
Let me carry it for you.

65
00:04:12,240 --> 00:04:13,719
Look at the cars, not me.

66
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:15,759
Afraid I'll drop it?

67
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:17,439
Afraid you can't afford to replace it.

68
00:04:17,879 --> 00:04:18,759
It's for your own good.

69
00:04:19,879 --> 00:04:21,360
How's this car?

70
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:23,519
If I drive this to pick up girls,

71
00:04:23,519 --> 00:04:24,560
what are my chances?

72
00:04:24,639 --> 00:04:26,959
Girls look at the man, not the car.

73
00:04:26,959 --> 00:04:28,040
You're so naive.

74
00:04:28,480 --> 00:04:29,160
Go haggle.

75
00:04:29,759 --> 00:04:30,439
Unless I cough,

76
00:04:30,439 --> 00:04:31,199
keep driving the price down.

77
00:04:31,319 --> 00:04:33,480
Boss, we're renting, not buying?

78
00:04:33,480 --> 00:04:35,040
Gold, property, Rolexes—

79
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:36,120
they appreciate after you buy them.

80
00:04:36,439 --> 00:04:38,040
This car depreciates the moment you get it.

81
00:04:38,319 --> 00:04:39,199
Just like love.

82
00:04:39,199 --> 00:04:41,199
Two pearls of wisdom, free of charge.

83
00:04:41,879 --> 00:04:42,600
Now go.

84
00:04:53,240 --> 00:04:55,079
Isn't your price marked a bit too high?

85
00:04:55,079 --> 00:04:56,439
Over 40?

86
00:04:56,439 --> 00:04:57,800
It was only in the 30s over there.

87
00:04:57,800 --> 00:04:58,439
That's not high.

88
00:04:58,439 --> 00:04:59,360
You see,

89
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:00,680
theirs are old cars, but mine is new.

90
00:05:00,680 --> 00:05:02,160
No way. I just checked over there.

91
00:05:02,160 --> 00:05:03,079
They're the exact same.

92
00:05:06,959 --> 00:05:08,000
No matter how new,

93
00:05:08,120 --> 00:05:09,680
it's still a used car, isn't it?

94
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:12,560
Let's talk over there. Over there.

95
00:05:23,759 --> 00:05:24,920
I'm too conspicuous.

96
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:26,800
Next time we meet,

97
00:05:27,600 --> 00:05:29,240
I might find a runner

98
00:05:30,160 --> 00:05:31,759
to go back and forth between us.

99
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:33,040
Who is he?

100
00:05:33,439 --> 00:05:34,680
Someone trustworthy.

101
00:05:35,319 --> 00:05:36,560
Someone who requires no direct contact.

102
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:48,000
Look how reasonable I'm being.

103
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:49,120
I didn't even ask for 1.8.

104
00:05:51,279 --> 00:05:52,000
One moment, Boss.

105
00:05:52,439 --> 00:05:53,399
I'll talk to you in a minute.

106
00:05:55,439 --> 00:05:57,120
I never heard you cough,

107
00:05:57,319 --> 00:05:58,639
so I had to keep driving the price down.

108
00:05:58,839 --> 00:06:00,600
I cut it so low even I felt embarrassed.

109
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:01,879
Leave him hanging for a bit.

110
00:06:02,319 --> 00:06:04,199
Go pick something up for me first.

111
00:06:04,439 --> 00:06:06,000
It's right nearby at People's Park.

112
00:06:06,519 --> 00:06:08,439
Someone at the gate will give you files.

113
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:09,360
Factory blueprints.

114
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:11,079
It might be in a file folder,

115
00:06:11,240 --> 00:06:12,759
or maybe a handbag.

116
00:06:12,759 --> 00:06:13,600
Come straight back once you get it.

117
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:16,439
A woman wearing a hat and jacket.

118
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:18,079
You'll spot her as soon as you get there.

119
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:21,279
Just say it's for Mr. Lin.

120
00:06:21,279 --> 00:06:21,959
Waiting for someone?

121
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:23,720
Who are you waiting for?

122
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:25,000
Myself.

123
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:28,759
Ignoring me, huh?

124
00:07:34,759 --> 00:07:36,040
Look at our boss.

125
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:37,680
He's a big businessman, you know.

126
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:39,240
He won't just rent one.

127
00:07:39,240 --> 00:07:40,800
Just knock off another 20%.

128
00:07:43,519 --> 00:07:44,959
I checked the park.

129
00:07:44,959 --> 00:07:46,240
There were plenty of people,

130
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:48,000
but the person you mentioned wasn't there.

131
00:07:58,079 --> 00:07:58,959
This is a new car.

132
00:07:58,959 --> 00:08:00,800
Why buy a new car?

133
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:19,879
A new car?

134
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:22,439
Didn't you say you'd rent, not buy?

135
00:08:22,439 --> 00:08:23,839
I liked it, so I bought it.

136
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:26,319
Life isn't just about pinching pennies.

137
00:08:26,680 --> 00:08:28,759
How many days do we get in a lifetime?

138
00:08:29,120 --> 00:08:30,279
Being happy is what counts.

139
00:08:30,839 --> 00:08:32,399
Where are we heading now?

140
00:08:32,639 --> 00:08:33,799
Ever been to Mount Wuyi?

141
00:08:34,159 --> 00:08:34,840
No.

142
00:08:35,519 --> 00:08:36,200
What about Zhangzhou?

143
00:08:36,559 --> 00:08:37,519
Haven't been there either.

144
00:08:37,919 --> 00:08:39,399
Are we going on another trip?

145
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:41,879
What did you think I went to Beijing for?

146
00:08:42,360 --> 00:08:43,519
Just to wine and dine every day?

147
00:08:43,759 --> 00:08:45,519
I'm planning to start a travel agency.

148
00:08:45,799 --> 00:08:46,840
With reform and opening up,

149
00:08:47,360 --> 00:08:49,200
there's so much money to be made.

150
00:08:49,559 --> 00:08:50,679
Your next task

151
00:08:50,679 --> 00:08:52,320
is to help me do market research.

152
00:08:52,679 --> 00:08:54,000
Scope out the market, one by one.

153
00:08:54,240 --> 00:08:55,480
starting with the biggest one:

154
00:08:55,679 --> 00:08:57,200
Shenzhou Strait Travel Agency.

155
00:08:58,480 --> 00:09:00,320
Lin Kanshan bought a new car.

156
00:09:02,720 --> 00:09:03,960
The laptop bag he never lets out of sight...

157
00:09:04,360 --> 00:09:05,200
"Let me carry it for you."

158
00:09:09,240 --> 00:09:11,519
Secretary Jin Lina went to People's Park.

159
00:09:12,200 --> 00:09:14,320
Lin Kanshan also went to People's Park.

160
00:09:14,600 --> 00:09:17,279
Cao Liaoping jogged in People's Park too.

161
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:20,320
And it's right next to the car mart.

162
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:24,720
All these people headed over there.

163
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:27,000
What a coincidence.

164
00:09:45,200 --> 00:09:46,440
Lin Kanshan took his secretary

165
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:47,799
to the Shenzhou Strait Travel Agency.

166
00:09:48,039 --> 00:09:49,120
Work just started,

167
00:09:49,679 --> 00:09:51,600
and Jinlan already has new business.

168
00:09:53,639 --> 00:09:54,320
Keep a close eye on them.

169
00:10:06,799 --> 00:10:09,320
If we're not going on the trip today,

170
00:10:09,320 --> 00:10:10,519
when are we going?

171
00:10:10,519 --> 00:10:11,399
For how many days?

172
00:10:11,600 --> 00:10:12,480
Why are you asking?

173
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:14,960
I have to ask for leave from school.

174
00:10:14,960 --> 00:10:16,360
They've been very strict lately.

175
00:10:16,559 --> 00:10:18,559
You must get leave to stay out overnight.

176
00:10:18,559 --> 00:10:21,039
Mainly because I failed too many classes.

177
00:10:21,039 --> 00:10:22,480
I'm afraid if I keep slacking off,

178
00:10:22,480 --> 00:10:23,960
I might get kicked out.

179
00:10:25,879 --> 00:10:27,320
Why ask so many detailed questions?

180
00:10:27,320 --> 00:10:28,440
I don't really know either.

181
00:10:28,559 --> 00:10:29,679
All I know is

182
00:10:29,679 --> 00:10:31,960
a few friends from Taipei are visiting,

183
00:10:31,960 --> 00:10:33,080
just to look around the area.

184
00:10:33,440 --> 00:10:34,879
Maybe a day, maybe two.

185
00:10:35,480 --> 00:10:37,120
So I need to check the prices first.

186
00:10:37,679 --> 00:10:38,759
Shop around.

187
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:40,440
Where do you think money comes from?

188
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:41,919
By saving it!

189
00:10:41,919 --> 00:10:43,919
Exactly. I'll wait for your good news.

190
00:10:55,919 --> 00:10:56,960
We're a chamber of commerce.

191
00:10:57,200 --> 00:10:58,159
The clients we bring

192
00:10:58,159 --> 00:10:59,799
will definitely keep pouring in.

193
00:10:59,919 --> 00:11:00,879
What kind of discount can you give us?

194
00:11:01,200 --> 00:11:03,600
Many tourists from Taiwan, China lately,

195
00:11:03,799 --> 00:11:04,679
and they're all our compatriots,

196
00:11:04,679 --> 00:11:06,200
so you should really give us a discount.

197
00:11:06,200 --> 00:11:08,559
Besides, we charter buses to Zhangzhou

198
00:11:08,559 --> 00:11:09,840
and Mount Wuyi,

199
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:11,320
so it's basically booking private tours.

200
00:11:11,679 --> 00:11:13,000
What's your bottom price?

201
00:11:13,159 --> 00:11:14,559
It's what I told you just now.

202
00:11:15,039 --> 00:11:16,320
The price really can't go any lower.

203
00:11:16,840 --> 00:11:17,960
If you don't believe me,

204
00:11:17,960 --> 00:11:19,360
you can ask at the state-run agency.

205
00:11:20,039 --> 00:11:21,080
Then I'll look around some more.

206
00:11:21,360 --> 00:11:21,799
Alright.

207
00:11:21,919 --> 00:11:24,399
Contact me anytime once you decide.

208
00:11:33,679 --> 00:11:34,279
Goodbye.

209
00:11:34,559 --> 00:11:35,159
Bye.

210
00:11:35,240 --> 00:11:35,879
Bye.

211
00:11:57,639 --> 00:11:58,440
Let's talk over there.

212
00:12:03,200 --> 00:12:04,519
As for your profile,

213
00:12:04,840 --> 00:12:05,960
I went through all of it.

214
00:12:05,960 --> 00:12:08,039
Gold-star guide for the whole province.

215
00:12:08,799 --> 00:12:09,919
Actually, I know

216
00:12:09,919 --> 00:12:11,879
you haven't been doing this for long.

217
00:12:11,879 --> 00:12:13,000
Yet in such a short time,

218
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:15,399
you made the top three pages of the roster.

219
00:12:15,679 --> 00:12:17,919
That shows you're truly skilled.

220
00:12:18,519 --> 00:12:19,879
There's just one small issue.

221
00:12:20,799 --> 00:12:23,039
The price is a bit... a bit high.

222
00:12:23,440 --> 00:12:25,399
And I know you have it tough.

223
00:12:25,399 --> 00:12:26,679
You earn some money,

224
00:12:26,679 --> 00:12:28,519
and your agency takes almost all of it.

225
00:12:28,960 --> 00:12:30,159
It's such a bad deal.

226
00:12:30,960 --> 00:12:32,000
What are you getting at?

227
00:12:34,360 --> 00:12:36,840
We could actually deal in private.

228
00:12:37,080 --> 00:12:39,519
You're guiding either way, right?

229
00:12:39,799 --> 00:12:40,440
I pay you,

230
00:12:40,440 --> 00:12:42,480
and you pocket all of it.

231
00:12:42,679 --> 00:12:43,320
What a great deal!

232
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:44,679
Take gigs on the side.

233
00:12:48,519 --> 00:12:49,639
Find someone else.

234
00:12:50,799 --> 00:12:53,240
Why turn down such a good deal?

235
00:12:53,600 --> 00:12:54,639
It's not worth the risk.

236
00:12:54,799 --> 00:12:55,919
Sneaking off for one trip

237
00:12:55,919 --> 00:12:57,639
and getting my tour guide license revoked?

238
00:12:57,639 --> 00:12:59,000
The math doesn't add up for me.

239
00:13:12,480 --> 00:13:14,440
The manager just walked by.

240
00:13:14,440 --> 00:13:15,480
You're speaking so loud,

241
00:13:15,480 --> 00:13:16,399
are you trying to ruin me?

242
00:13:21,240 --> 00:13:22,679
How many are in the group you mentioned?

243
00:13:22,679 --> 00:13:23,639
What day are they arriving exactly?

244
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:24,960
We haven't decided yet.

245
00:13:24,960 --> 00:13:26,840
Once we do, I'll tell you right away.

246
00:13:27,799 --> 00:13:28,919
Call or page me.

247
00:13:28,919 --> 00:13:30,759
I'm on call 24 hours a day.

248
00:13:30,759 --> 00:13:32,080
This name of yours...

249
00:13:33,039 --> 00:13:34,159
sounds like a pen name.

250
00:13:35,080 --> 00:13:36,240
Like a poet.

251
00:13:47,480 --> 00:13:48,679
It's in the bag.

252
00:13:49,960 --> 00:13:51,799
Personally, I think it's in the bag.

253
00:13:52,639 --> 00:13:53,480
How did you pull that off?

254
00:13:53,480 --> 00:13:54,440
Through whom?

255
00:13:54,440 --> 00:13:56,240
Well, look here.

256
00:13:57,200 --> 00:13:58,000
Her name is Jinlan.

257
00:13:58,600 --> 00:14:00,120
She really knows how things work.

258
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:01,759
I've already talked it over with her.

259
00:14:01,759 --> 00:14:03,840
She can take groups of any size on the side.

260
00:14:04,159 --> 00:14:06,480
We just haven't agreed on the final price.

261
00:14:06,720 --> 00:14:08,200
What do you think of her?

262
00:14:09,080 --> 00:14:11,159
Very smart. Catches on right away.

263
00:14:11,159 --> 00:14:12,399
A quick thinker.

264
00:14:12,399 --> 00:14:13,240
Quicker than you?

265
00:14:13,799 --> 00:14:15,120
Well...

266
00:14:15,120 --> 00:14:16,279
Pretty much the same, anyway.

267
00:14:18,559 --> 00:14:20,039
Fine, I'll take your word for it.

268
00:14:20,840 --> 00:14:21,759
We'll go to her next time.

269
00:14:22,080 --> 00:14:22,559
Great.

270
00:14:24,600 --> 00:14:26,279
Units handling state secrets

271
00:14:26,519 --> 00:14:29,159
must establish confidentiality bodies

272
00:14:29,559 --> 00:14:32,080
and appoint dedicated confidentiality staff.

273
00:14:32,399 --> 00:14:36,080
They must also provide their personnel

274
00:14:36,080 --> 00:14:37,559
with confidentiality education,

275
00:14:37,759 --> 00:14:39,159
establish confidentiality regulations,

276
00:14:39,360 --> 00:14:41,000
and improve confidentiality facilities.

277
00:14:41,360 --> 00:14:42,799
Upon discovering a leak,

278
00:14:43,159 --> 00:14:45,399
they must, from learning of it,

279
00:14:45,399 --> 00:14:47,080
within 24 hours,

280
00:14:47,080 --> 00:14:49,720
promptly report to confidentiality authorities.

281
00:14:50,639 --> 00:14:52,399
As for leaking state secrets,

282
00:14:52,600 --> 00:14:53,679
if the circumstances are serious

283
00:14:54,399 --> 00:14:55,679
and constitute a crime,

284
00:14:55,679 --> 00:14:57,759
criminal liability shall be pursued by law.

285
00:14:58,279 --> 00:15:00,080
I'd like to elaborate on

286
00:15:00,600 --> 00:15:03,559
the specific circumstances and sentencing criteria.

287
00:15:03,799 --> 00:15:06,399
What does "especially serious" mean?

288
00:15:07,000 --> 00:15:09,480
For example, providing top-secret files

289
00:15:09,480 --> 00:15:12,399
to overseas espionage organizations,

290
00:15:12,399 --> 00:15:16,519
causing core secrets to fall into enemy hands,

291
00:15:16,519 --> 00:15:18,759
and leading to exceptionally grave

292
00:15:18,919 --> 00:15:22,480
political, military, or economic losses

293
00:15:22,480 --> 00:15:24,559
counts as especially serious circumstances.

294
00:15:24,559 --> 00:15:25,440
Are you free at noon?

295
00:15:25,679 --> 00:15:27,039
Let's sit down for a drink.

296
00:15:28,399 --> 00:15:29,200
A drink?

297
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:33,720
We must make everyone truly understand

298
00:15:34,200 --> 00:15:36,000
what secrets are and how to protect them.

299
00:15:38,519 --> 00:15:40,080
Back to school or the military base?

300
00:15:40,080 --> 00:15:41,000
I'll give you a ride.

301
00:15:43,720 --> 00:15:45,440
I've been staying at school lately.

302
00:15:48,480 --> 00:15:49,559
Had a fight with your aunt?

303
00:15:52,120 --> 00:15:53,159
Not really.

304
00:15:53,799 --> 00:15:55,480
She's just been swamped lately.

305
00:15:55,480 --> 00:15:57,000
She has to work night shifts too.

306
00:15:57,360 --> 00:15:59,360
Going home would only get in her way.

307
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:01,960
Your aunt is a military officer, right?

308
00:16:02,320 --> 00:16:03,200
What is she in charge of?

309
00:16:03,799 --> 00:16:05,240
I don't know either.

310
00:16:05,840 --> 00:16:07,799
I don't really understand that stuff.

311
00:16:08,399 --> 00:16:10,480
We should treat them to dinner sometime.

312
00:16:10,799 --> 00:16:11,960
Otherwise, people might think

313
00:16:11,960 --> 00:16:13,519
I'm up to no good with you.

314
00:16:13,519 --> 00:16:14,480
A meal together

315
00:16:14,480 --> 00:16:16,120
would put the chief's mind at ease too.

316
00:16:16,399 --> 00:16:17,080
What do you say?

317
00:16:18,360 --> 00:16:19,720
I couldn't impose like that.

318
00:16:20,919 --> 00:16:22,679
Let's wait until they're less busy.

319
00:16:22,919 --> 00:16:23,279
Right.

320
00:16:23,559 --> 00:16:25,639
I found out what you asked about earlier.

321
00:16:26,120 --> 00:16:28,639
I asked Xiao Lu which car is most popular.

322
00:16:28,639 --> 00:16:30,440
He said our car is already the best.

323
00:16:30,440 --> 00:16:31,360
None better.

324
00:16:31,360 --> 00:16:33,639
You can ask him about cars anytime.

325
00:16:33,639 --> 00:16:34,600
Didn't he tell you?

326
00:16:35,399 --> 00:16:36,200
Tell me what?

327
00:16:49,080 --> 00:16:49,840
Thanks, boss.

328
00:16:52,240 --> 00:16:52,919
Thanks, chef.

329
00:16:52,919 --> 00:16:53,960
All right, take care. Next!

330
00:16:53,960 --> 00:16:54,559
Braised pork, please.

331
00:16:56,200 --> 00:16:57,399
Did your team figure it out yet?

332
00:16:57,919 --> 00:16:58,440
What?

333
00:16:58,919 --> 00:17:00,080
Wasn't there an unsolved case?

334
00:17:00,159 --> 00:17:00,919
That's enough, chef.

335
00:17:02,120 --> 00:17:02,799
All right, here's yours.

336
00:17:02,799 --> 00:17:03,960
Take care. Next!

337
00:17:03,960 --> 00:17:05,079
Lychee pork and greens.

338
00:17:05,319 --> 00:17:06,720
We're out of lychee pork.

339
00:17:06,720 --> 00:17:07,519
Tomato and eggs, then.

340
00:17:07,720 --> 00:17:08,519
All right.

341
00:17:13,079 --> 00:17:14,160
This thing isn't cheap.

342
00:17:15,200 --> 00:17:16,519
Costs months of wages.

343
00:17:16,759 --> 00:17:17,799
Pocket change.

344
00:17:20,880 --> 00:17:21,839
It's my classmate's.

345
00:17:21,839 --> 00:17:23,240
Got money, so they splurge.

346
00:17:23,440 --> 00:17:25,440
But they don't even keep it dry.

347
00:17:25,440 --> 00:17:26,759
When it breaks, they have others fix it.

348
00:17:26,759 --> 00:17:28,640
Once fixed, I'll wear it for a few days.

349
00:17:28,960 --> 00:17:29,920
Here's your food.

350
00:17:29,920 --> 00:17:30,519
Thanks, chef.

351
00:17:30,519 --> 00:17:31,440
Greens and eggplant.

352
00:17:35,839 --> 00:17:36,400
Brother Qi.

353
00:17:43,640 --> 00:17:44,920
Still couldn't decode it.

354
00:17:45,200 --> 00:17:47,319
If those symbols and numbers are a code,

355
00:17:47,759 --> 00:17:48,920
there's no logic to them at all.

356
00:17:51,559 --> 00:17:53,000
Actually, the more material there is,

357
00:17:53,240 --> 00:17:54,519
the more patterns emerge.

358
00:17:54,759 --> 00:17:55,960
That's the problem.

359
00:17:56,640 --> 00:17:57,640
There's still too little to go on.

360
00:17:58,079 --> 00:18:00,960
When appropriate, we can open a case.

361
00:18:00,960 --> 00:18:02,960
Once 24-hour wiretapping is set up,

362
00:18:03,279 --> 00:18:05,079
we won't even miss their sleep talk.

363
00:18:16,680 --> 00:18:18,319
On my last business trip to Beijing,

364
00:18:18,319 --> 00:18:19,720
I was saying on the plane

365
00:18:20,240 --> 00:18:21,599
that in our whole institute,

366
00:18:21,960 --> 00:18:22,799
the one I admire most

367
00:18:22,799 --> 00:18:24,599
is Professor Cao Liaoping.

368
00:18:25,279 --> 00:18:27,160
You've achieved true personal freedom.

369
00:18:27,160 --> 00:18:29,200
When you two get off work, you're done.

370
00:18:29,559 --> 00:18:30,559
Dancing a little,

371
00:18:30,559 --> 00:18:31,440
fishing a little...

372
00:18:31,440 --> 00:18:32,640
Couldn't be more carefree.

373
00:18:33,359 --> 00:18:34,480
Not having kids

374
00:18:34,680 --> 00:18:36,720
was definitely your best decision.

375
00:18:36,720 --> 00:18:37,720
Years ago,

376
00:18:37,720 --> 00:18:39,880
I didn't really get this whole DINK thing.

377
00:18:39,880 --> 00:18:41,440
I always thought it was weird.

378
00:18:41,440 --> 00:18:43,680
Lately, I argue with my kid every day,

379
00:18:43,680 --> 00:18:45,240
it almost gave me a heart attack.

380
00:18:45,599 --> 00:18:47,359
Where did you get the courage back then?

381
00:19:00,240 --> 00:19:01,000
Have you heard?

382
00:19:01,480 --> 00:19:02,680
Last time in Beijing,

383
00:19:02,880 --> 00:19:04,279
didn't you leave early?

384
00:19:04,279 --> 00:19:06,079
Old Jia drank way too much,

385
00:19:06,079 --> 00:19:07,920
and bawled his eyes out.

386
00:19:08,599 --> 00:19:11,359
Said his wife won't let him in bed,

387
00:19:11,359 --> 00:19:12,960
separated after he got back from Germany.

388
00:19:13,200 --> 00:19:14,720
All our colleagues were right there.

389
00:19:15,240 --> 00:19:16,880
Not a shred of dignity left.

390
00:19:17,200 --> 00:19:17,920
Liaoping.

391
00:19:18,839 --> 00:19:19,799
Let's leave it at that.

392
00:19:20,759 --> 00:19:21,519
Cut it out, everyone.

393
00:19:27,160 --> 00:19:28,759
It's not like I want to make trouble.

394
00:19:29,079 --> 00:19:31,200
Besides, isn't he too ashamed to return?

395
00:19:31,559 --> 00:19:33,359
Hiding in the research building all day.

396
00:19:33,359 --> 00:19:36,079
Being alone in that office all day,

397
00:19:36,319 --> 00:19:37,279
doesn't it get suffocating?

398
00:19:40,160 --> 00:19:41,119
I'm going to the restroom.

399
00:19:41,480 --> 00:19:42,319
Been holding it in forever.

400
00:19:42,440 --> 00:19:42,799
All right.

401
00:19:54,200 --> 00:19:55,400
Lao Cao went

402
00:19:55,400 --> 00:19:56,279
to use the restroom.

403
00:19:56,279 --> 00:19:57,680
He's been holding it in for a while.

404
00:19:58,240 --> 00:20:00,119
Chief, I'm not late, am I?

405
00:20:00,279 --> 00:20:00,960
No, not at all.

406
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:09,640
Director.

407
00:20:16,119 --> 00:20:17,880
There's something... something big.

408
00:20:18,240 --> 00:20:19,359
I want to report directly to you.

409
00:20:20,559 --> 00:20:21,559
After knocking,

410
00:20:21,559 --> 00:20:22,680
wait for my answer before coming in.

411
00:20:23,279 --> 00:20:23,920
I'm sorry.

412
00:20:25,200 --> 00:20:26,119
No matter how big it is,

413
00:20:26,839 --> 00:20:27,839
you're bypassing the chain of command.

414
00:20:28,359 --> 00:20:29,880
You should report this to Wu Jiali.

415
00:20:30,160 --> 00:20:31,039
Isn't he in the building?

416
00:20:33,480 --> 00:20:34,240
What is it?

417
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:36,839
I suspect someone.

418
00:20:37,000 --> 00:20:37,839
Someone close to us.

419
00:20:38,359 --> 00:20:39,240
The evidence is inside.

420
00:20:41,720 --> 00:20:42,920
I know the consequences of this.

421
00:20:43,319 --> 00:20:44,720
I'm ready to accept any disciplinary action.

422
00:20:49,240 --> 00:20:50,960
If it weren't you standing here,

423
00:20:51,720 --> 00:20:53,880
but a colleague you work with every day—

424
00:20:54,160 --> 00:20:54,960
Ma Qi,

425
00:20:55,599 --> 00:20:56,519
Wu Jiali,

426
00:20:56,759 --> 00:20:58,279
Chunxiao, or Jinlan—

427
00:20:58,599 --> 00:20:59,920
and they came to me,

428
00:21:00,200 --> 00:21:01,559
saying you're compromised,

429
00:21:02,359 --> 00:21:04,440
without anyone knowing,

430
00:21:04,440 --> 00:21:05,359
conducting a secret investigation...

431
00:21:05,680 --> 00:21:06,720
If you were in my shoes,

432
00:21:06,720 --> 00:21:07,799
what would you think?

433
00:21:09,079 --> 00:21:10,920
Only if you have ironclad evidence

434
00:21:11,559 --> 00:21:13,160
can you report it to the organization.

435
00:21:27,640 --> 00:21:28,759
You're not Juntong,

436
00:21:29,039 --> 00:21:30,160
and I'm not Zhongtong.

437
00:21:31,160 --> 00:21:32,599
When it comes to unauthorized investigations,

438
00:21:33,279 --> 00:21:34,519
once that door is opened,

439
00:21:35,200 --> 00:21:38,240
it will rip trust apart, flesh and bone.

440
00:21:38,440 --> 00:21:39,240
At that point,

441
00:21:39,480 --> 00:21:40,640
you investigate me, I investigate you,

442
00:21:40,880 --> 00:21:41,640
everyone denouncing one another,

443
00:21:41,640 --> 00:21:42,799
with complaint letters flooding in.

444
00:21:43,119 --> 00:21:44,799
What's the point of discipline then?

445
00:21:46,559 --> 00:21:47,319
Comrade Huadong,

446
00:21:49,759 --> 00:21:50,839
have you ever considered this:

447
00:21:51,200 --> 00:21:52,559
What if you're wrong?

448
00:21:52,559 --> 00:21:54,559
The wall knocked down in that person's heart—

449
00:21:55,720 --> 00:21:56,960
how are you going to rebuild it?

450
00:22:05,880 --> 00:22:08,200
Come see me in the Technical Section now.

451
00:22:25,559 --> 00:22:26,759
They're starving over there.

452
00:22:27,680 --> 00:22:29,799
They even want to know how much I eat.

453
00:22:30,359 --> 00:22:32,000
When did Tech Section intercept it?

454
00:22:32,319 --> 00:22:33,240
Early this morning.

455
00:22:34,599 --> 00:22:37,319
I've reviewed all the action plans.

456
00:22:37,400 --> 00:22:38,440
In Operation Spring Thunder,

457
00:22:38,920 --> 00:22:39,720
you'll fire the first shot.

458
00:22:40,440 --> 00:22:41,200
Hit Antique Street first.

459
00:22:41,720 --> 00:22:42,519
Make sure it's a resounding success.

460
00:22:43,000 --> 00:22:45,799
It's a hub for intelligence brokers.

461
00:22:45,960 --> 00:22:47,599
The closer and longer we watch them,

462
00:22:47,599 --> 00:22:48,519
the better our chances of success.

463
00:22:48,720 --> 00:22:51,200
Antique Street is the MIB's true core,

464
00:22:51,200 --> 00:22:53,759
while Taiwan, China's election is a front.

465
00:22:54,119 --> 00:22:56,599
This time, we'll strip them of both.

466
00:22:56,599 --> 00:22:57,599
Kill two birds with one stone.

467
00:22:57,599 --> 00:22:59,440
Aim to catch the internal leaker

468
00:22:59,440 --> 00:23:00,920
in the same sweep.

469
00:23:02,039 --> 00:23:02,920
If we pull this off,

470
00:23:03,200 --> 00:23:04,440
we'll catch both small fry and big fish.

471
00:23:05,680 --> 00:23:06,559
Is everyone here?

472
00:23:06,759 --> 00:23:07,680
All here, Director.

473
00:23:07,680 --> 00:23:08,920
Countdown to Operation Spring Thunder.

474
00:23:08,920 --> 00:23:10,319
All provinces and cities will act as one.

475
00:23:10,319 --> 00:23:13,160
Before the ministry gives the launch time,

476
00:23:13,160 --> 00:23:15,440
we must prepare everything flawlessly.

477
00:23:15,799 --> 00:23:17,519
Old Wei, brief us on Antique Street.

478
00:23:17,680 --> 00:23:18,279
Thanks.

479
00:23:18,400 --> 00:23:20,119
Thanks, Brother Cai. May your business prosper!

480
00:23:20,119 --> 00:23:21,640
I'd prosper if you paid me back sooner!

481
00:23:21,640 --> 00:23:22,400
Absolutely, will do!

482
00:23:36,559 --> 00:23:37,640
Newspapers?

483
00:23:38,079 --> 00:23:38,759
Sure, we have them.

484
00:23:39,640 --> 00:23:41,039
Got Reference News,

485
00:23:41,440 --> 00:23:42,319
People's Daily...

486
00:23:42,319 --> 00:23:43,559
Which year are you looking for?

487
00:23:45,000 --> 00:23:46,359
Nothing recent, though.

488
00:23:46,359 --> 00:23:47,880
This is an antique shop.

489
00:23:49,440 --> 00:23:50,880
No PLA Daily,

490
00:23:51,759 --> 00:23:54,319
but I've got a PLA telescope. Want it?

491
00:24:15,039 --> 00:24:16,039
Listen,

492
00:24:16,480 --> 00:24:18,400
Lao Xiao's debt is almost due.

493
00:24:18,599 --> 00:24:19,599
Keep a close eye on him.

494
00:24:36,599 --> 00:24:38,640
The Commerce Bureau is hosting HK guests,

495
00:24:39,279 --> 00:24:40,759
so I'll probably be back late.

496
00:24:42,039 --> 00:24:42,880
Don't wait up.

497
00:24:42,880 --> 00:24:44,039
Go ahead and get some rest.

498
00:24:45,680 --> 00:24:48,200
Remember over the next couple of days

499
00:24:48,960 --> 00:24:51,240
to help Dad get up and walk around when you can.

500
00:24:51,519 --> 00:24:52,920
He can't just lie in bed all the time.

501
00:24:53,200 --> 00:24:54,680
Didn't your brother say he was coming back?

502
00:24:54,680 --> 00:24:55,759
Is his unit not letting him go?

503
00:24:57,279 --> 00:24:59,079
Are they running another exercise?

504
00:25:14,559 --> 00:25:17,079
God of Wealth, I'm tight on cash lately.

505
00:25:19,839 --> 00:25:20,880
How much did you lose this time?

506
00:25:21,799 --> 00:25:24,240
I need a loan to win it back.

507
00:25:24,519 --> 00:25:25,000
How much?

508
00:25:25,000 --> 00:25:26,039
Give me 3,000 first.

509
00:25:33,720 --> 00:25:34,920
When are you paying me back?

510
00:25:34,920 --> 00:25:36,920
I'll pay you as soon as I come back down.

511
00:25:42,559 --> 00:25:43,079
Does it work?

512
00:25:43,079 --> 00:25:44,599
Which master blessed it?

513
00:25:44,599 --> 00:25:45,799
Let me share in some of that luck.

514
00:25:46,960 --> 00:25:48,759
It works if you believe.

515
00:25:52,759 --> 00:25:54,599
It works for whoever believes.

516
00:25:56,799 --> 00:25:57,920
Strike it rich! Strike it rich!

517
00:25:58,359 --> 00:25:59,920
It works for whoever believes.

518
00:26:00,200 --> 00:26:00,680
I'm off.

519
00:26:01,200 --> 00:26:01,880
Strike it rich!

520
00:26:03,680 --> 00:26:05,880
Strike it rich! It works for whoever believes.

521
00:26:11,880 --> 00:26:12,920
It works if you believe.

522
00:26:42,319 --> 00:26:43,480
Place your bets. Place your bets.

523
00:26:43,640 --> 00:26:44,440
Bet.

524
00:26:44,920 --> 00:26:45,440
Bet.

525
00:26:46,240 --> 00:26:47,079
This is boring.

526
00:26:56,759 --> 00:26:57,440
Let's check out something else.

527
00:26:57,440 --> 00:26:58,400
Seriously.

528
00:26:59,640 --> 00:27:00,599
Come look over here.

529
00:27:04,720 --> 00:27:05,720
Deal, deal, deal!

530
00:27:15,240 --> 00:27:16,000
Keep going.

531
00:27:18,599 --> 00:27:19,480
What lousy cards.

532
00:27:19,920 --> 00:27:21,079
It's starting. It's starting.

533
00:27:21,079 --> 00:27:22,599
Starting, starting. Come on.

534
00:27:22,759 --> 00:27:23,119
Bet big.

535
00:27:24,480 --> 00:27:25,680
Has Lin Kanshan contacted you?

536
00:27:26,039 --> 00:27:28,079
No dividends yet since signing the contract.

537
00:27:28,279 --> 00:27:29,440
The first payout will arrive soon.

538
00:27:29,799 --> 00:27:31,599
Once he sees the profits and revenue,

539
00:27:31,839 --> 00:27:33,119
he'll probably move into my house.

540
00:27:34,000 --> 00:27:36,000
Profit is the best glue for cooperation.

541
00:27:36,000 --> 00:27:37,880
Sticks tight, impossible to tear apart.

542
00:27:38,480 --> 00:27:39,799
The KMT never understood that.

543
00:27:41,000 --> 00:27:42,440
As long as someone does.

544
00:27:43,519 --> 00:27:44,240
Time to eat.

545
00:27:49,640 --> 00:27:50,799
You came to see me.

546
00:27:51,519 --> 00:27:53,000
You have something to say, don't you?

547
00:27:56,440 --> 00:27:57,440
About the leak...

548
00:27:57,960 --> 00:27:58,960
any new leads recently?

549
00:28:07,640 --> 00:28:08,519
You definitely know.

550
00:28:14,759 --> 00:28:16,400
You must have a suspect.

551
00:28:18,599 --> 00:28:20,039
I suspect everyone, including you.

552
00:28:23,880 --> 00:28:25,440
What do you think of He Chunxiao?

553
00:28:28,000 --> 00:28:29,079
You suspect him?

554
00:28:32,960 --> 00:28:33,799
I don't think it's him.

555
00:28:34,839 --> 00:28:36,000
I can smell it on people.

556
00:28:36,000 --> 00:28:37,160
He doesn't have that scent.

557
00:28:37,160 --> 00:28:38,119
Cut the crap.

558
00:28:38,119 --> 00:28:38,920
Intuition matters.

559
00:28:38,920 --> 00:28:39,920
You're the one who said that.

560
00:28:40,200 --> 00:28:41,440
That was when I was young.

561
00:28:41,720 --> 00:28:43,640
Now, I don't trust intuition.

562
00:28:43,960 --> 00:28:45,000
Only evidence.

563
00:28:46,720 --> 00:28:48,200
Then let me tell you what evidence is.

564
00:28:48,480 --> 00:28:49,559
That time we caught the postman,

565
00:28:50,119 --> 00:28:51,920
the target bolted from the alley opposite us.

566
00:28:52,079 --> 00:28:53,039
I thought back carefully.

567
00:28:53,440 --> 00:28:54,799
He Chunxiao was completely dazed.

568
00:28:55,200 --> 00:28:56,119
He had zero reaction.

569
00:28:56,440 --> 00:28:57,839
If he hadn't been in shock,

570
00:28:57,839 --> 00:28:59,119
putting on an act, or raising a ruckus,

571
00:28:59,119 --> 00:28:59,960
that would've been suspicious.

572
00:29:00,720 --> 00:29:02,799
His dazed state was genuine.

573
00:29:03,400 --> 00:29:04,160
Unless...

574
00:29:05,240 --> 00:29:06,200
he's another caliber of master,

575
00:29:06,440 --> 00:29:07,240
exceptionally gifted.

576
00:29:09,200 --> 00:29:12,200
Of course, that's next to impossible.

577
00:29:12,640 --> 00:29:14,200
In the municipal bureau, apart from myself,

578
00:29:14,440 --> 00:29:17,200
I've never seen anyone with that talent.

579
00:29:19,200 --> 00:29:20,880
What, you want to test him?

580
00:29:23,119 --> 00:29:23,880
If we test,

581
00:29:24,359 --> 00:29:25,359
we test everyone.

582
00:29:26,079 --> 00:29:28,359
Antique Street is the best touchstone.

583
00:29:28,359 --> 00:29:29,440
Sound the spring thunder,

584
00:29:29,920 --> 00:29:31,000
bust the hideout,

585
00:29:31,000 --> 00:29:32,000
and catch the mole.

586
00:29:32,000 --> 00:29:32,960
Three in one.

587
00:29:33,240 --> 00:29:35,160
Every division, section, and team

588
00:29:35,160 --> 00:29:36,079
will have an opening left open.

589
00:29:36,319 --> 00:29:38,200
Whichever opening leaks information,

590
00:29:38,880 --> 00:29:40,599
the people there are compromised.

591
00:29:42,920 --> 00:29:44,359
Then why are you telling me this?

592
00:29:44,599 --> 00:29:45,799
Aren't you afraid I'll leak it?

593
00:29:45,799 --> 00:29:47,559
I was worried you'd lose your head,

594
00:29:47,880 --> 00:29:49,680
so I'm giving you a warning shot today.

595
00:29:51,200 --> 00:29:52,240
If this somehow gets leaked,

596
00:29:52,240 --> 00:29:53,440
I'll be under suspicion too.

597
00:29:55,359 --> 00:29:57,319
Just because I don't give you New Year gifts

598
00:29:57,319 --> 00:29:58,200
and talk back to you sometimes,

599
00:29:58,200 --> 00:29:59,720
you can't make things difficult for me.

600
00:30:00,039 --> 00:30:00,720
That's enough.

601
00:30:01,039 --> 00:30:01,839
Go scrub the wok.

602
00:30:04,759 --> 00:30:07,480
Honestly, who do you suspect?

603
00:30:13,559 --> 00:30:15,240
I'm off, gotta catch a bus.

604
00:30:19,440 --> 00:30:21,519
Hua Shao, working overtime?

605
00:30:51,319 --> 00:30:52,240
What's going on?

606
00:30:52,559 --> 00:30:53,359
Paging me like this...

607
00:30:53,359 --> 00:30:54,960
My pager's battery is about to die.

608
00:30:55,200 --> 00:30:56,799
Stop buzzing me over and over.

609
00:30:57,359 --> 00:30:58,039
What do you want?

610
00:30:58,039 --> 00:30:59,480
A get-together, obviously.

611
00:30:59,559 --> 00:31:00,960
Taijiang Restaurant. Just missing you.

612
00:31:00,960 --> 00:31:01,880
Are you coming or not?

613
00:31:03,559 --> 00:31:04,440
I'm busy.

614
00:31:05,079 --> 00:31:06,279
My boss invited me out for drinks.

615
00:31:06,279 --> 00:31:07,400
I can't really turn him down.

616
00:31:08,440 --> 00:31:10,200
It's driving me crazy.

617
00:31:10,440 --> 00:31:12,359
I don't even have time to date.

618
00:31:12,359 --> 00:31:13,440
I'm gonna be a bachelor for life.

619
00:31:14,680 --> 00:31:16,319
Look at you, all official in that uniform.

620
00:31:16,440 --> 00:31:17,519
Such a busy man, aren't you?

621
00:31:17,839 --> 00:31:18,359
Fine. If you're not coming,

622
00:31:18,359 --> 00:31:19,680
we'll wrap it up soon.

623
00:31:20,640 --> 00:31:21,680
Don't break up the party!

624
00:31:22,319 --> 00:31:22,920
Wait for me no matter what.

625
00:31:23,960 --> 00:31:26,240
The hot pot place by the school?

626
00:31:26,440 --> 00:31:27,079
Yeah.

627
00:31:27,359 --> 00:31:28,480
How long will you take to get here?

628
00:31:30,559 --> 00:31:31,960
About half an hour.

629
00:31:31,960 --> 00:31:34,039
I'll have my boss drop me off.

630
00:31:35,599 --> 00:31:36,240
Gotta go.

631
00:31:36,240 --> 00:31:37,240
My boss's car is here.

632
00:31:37,240 --> 00:31:38,160
Deal. Make sure you come.

633
00:31:44,000 --> 00:31:46,039
Bless me with wealth and fortune...

634
00:31:46,319 --> 00:31:47,839
Bless me to strike it rich this year.

635
00:31:48,319 --> 00:31:49,839
Bless me to strike it rich this year.

636
00:31:50,359 --> 00:31:51,880
Bless me to strike it rich this year.

637
00:31:54,559 --> 00:31:55,599
Much obliged, God of Wealth.

638
00:31:57,759 --> 00:31:59,559
I knew this was a scam.

639
00:31:59,960 --> 00:32:01,000
Out of all these prayer beads,

640
00:32:01,000 --> 00:32:02,319
tell me, which one actually works?

641
00:32:02,319 --> 00:32:03,680
And which one doesn't?

642
00:32:06,279 --> 00:32:06,680
Have some tea.

643
00:32:06,799 --> 00:32:07,240
Drink your tea.

644
00:32:07,400 --> 00:32:09,400
If drinking tea worked, I'd do that too.

645
00:32:09,640 --> 00:32:11,559
Your tea leaves better be consecrated too.

646
00:32:12,240 --> 00:32:14,119
These beads are all brand new.

647
00:32:15,279 --> 00:32:17,079
Only yours are consecrated?

648
00:32:17,079 --> 00:32:19,839
Go fool the rookies at the antique shop.

649
00:32:20,200 --> 00:32:21,680
I was up there for less than half an hour,

650
00:32:21,920 --> 00:32:23,359
and I lost the shirt off my back.

651
00:32:23,559 --> 00:32:24,400
If you believe,

652
00:32:25,559 --> 00:32:26,160
it works.

653
00:32:29,920 --> 00:32:30,839
Fine, I believe you.

654
00:32:32,000 --> 00:32:33,240
Give me another 5,000 yuan.

655
00:32:44,519 --> 00:32:45,279
Look closely.

656
00:32:45,640 --> 00:32:47,039
There's only

657
00:32:47,039 --> 00:32:49,279
11 hours and 50 minutes left

658
00:32:50,480 --> 00:32:52,599
until our agreed repayment deadline.

659
00:32:52,920 --> 00:32:54,160
We're from the same hometown.

660
00:32:54,359 --> 00:32:55,279
We're brothers.

661
00:32:55,799 --> 00:32:57,240
If you don't pay me back,

662
00:32:57,920 --> 00:32:59,240
I won't chop off your hands.

663
00:33:01,440 --> 00:33:02,839
Instead, I'll go to that... what's it called?

664
00:33:04,440 --> 00:33:05,039
The Discipline Inspection Commission.

665
00:33:05,839 --> 00:33:06,880
Go to your workplace.

666
00:33:09,599 --> 00:33:10,240
Go to your father-in-law's.

667
00:33:11,720 --> 00:33:12,480
Ah Cai,

668
00:33:14,119 --> 00:33:15,359
are you trying to ruin me?

669
00:33:15,839 --> 00:33:17,319
Don't forget I'm an official.

670
00:33:17,559 --> 00:33:19,200
If you ruin me, I'll make you bleed too.

671
00:33:25,000 --> 00:33:26,839
Forget about borrowing that 5,000 yuan.

672
00:33:29,200 --> 00:33:31,400
You can't pay it back.

673
00:33:48,720 --> 00:33:50,480
I have intel on the military exercise.

674
00:33:50,839 --> 00:33:51,559
Do you want it?

675
00:33:51,799 --> 00:33:53,440
I've been watching for a long time.

676
00:33:53,759 --> 00:33:54,759
Last time didn't count.

677
00:33:54,759 --> 00:33:55,880
It's definitely accurate this time.

678
00:33:56,160 --> 00:33:59,000
They'll fire several Dongfeng missiles tomorrow morning.

679
00:33:59,440 --> 00:34:00,920
No later than eight in the morning.

680
00:34:00,920 --> 00:34:02,359
You can wait and see.

681
00:34:02,359 --> 00:34:03,039
If it proves true,

682
00:34:03,039 --> 00:34:05,119
I want more money, in cash.

683
00:34:05,480 --> 00:34:07,960
Cash on delivery.

684
00:34:08,199 --> 00:34:09,559
I'm in a real hurry.

685
00:34:09,559 --> 00:34:11,000
The sooner, the better.

686
00:34:11,199 --> 00:34:12,400
Hurry up, hurry up.

687
00:34:12,400 --> 00:34:13,760
Anyone can deliver the money.

688
00:34:15,360 --> 00:34:16,159
The secret code.

689
00:34:22,199 --> 00:34:22,840
Copy that.

690
00:34:30,320 --> 00:34:33,039
Mr. Ma, someone will be gambling tomorrow.

691
00:34:33,159 --> 00:34:34,400
He has something good on him.

692
00:34:35,079 --> 00:34:36,880
Related to the firecrackers in the sea.

693
00:34:37,079 --> 00:34:37,920
Whether it's real or not,

694
00:34:38,280 --> 00:34:39,639
we'll know by eight in the morning.

695
00:34:39,840 --> 00:34:40,760
Interested?

696
00:34:41,000 --> 00:34:42,400
I've always been interested in people.

697
00:34:42,679 --> 00:34:43,760
Who's picking up the goods from him?

698
00:34:43,760 --> 00:34:44,679
Do you know?

699
00:34:44,760 --> 00:34:46,559
I heard Spring Thunder will crack soon.

700
00:34:46,880 --> 00:34:49,199
You won't even tell me where it's safe.

701
00:34:49,760 --> 00:34:50,880
Let me go lay low somewhere.

702
00:34:51,159 --> 00:34:52,199
I'm just like you.

703
00:34:52,199 --> 00:34:53,199
I only know it'll crack,

704
00:34:53,199 --> 00:34:54,239
not what day it'll happen.

705
00:34:54,679 --> 00:34:56,320
Just stay away from Minzhong for now.

706
00:34:56,320 --> 00:34:57,880
That guy you just mentioned,

707
00:34:58,280 --> 00:34:59,480
where is he gambling?

708
00:34:59,840 --> 00:35:00,800
Antique Street.

709
00:35:00,880 --> 00:35:01,480
Be more specific.

710
00:35:01,840 --> 00:35:03,079
What's the handover code?

711
00:35:20,079 --> 00:35:21,599
Pretty good profits, huh?

712
00:35:33,840 --> 00:35:34,440
Brother Qi.

713
00:35:35,039 --> 00:35:36,400
I was just about to call you.

714
00:35:36,880 --> 00:35:37,559
Thought you might be asleep,

715
00:35:37,559 --> 00:35:38,679
and didn't want to disturb your rest.

716
00:35:38,679 --> 00:35:40,239
It's all received, down to the last cent.

717
00:35:42,079 --> 00:35:43,480
No need to be so particular.

718
00:35:43,480 --> 00:35:44,960
We're all brothers here.

719
00:35:45,159 --> 00:35:47,000
It doesn't matter if it's off by a bit.

720
00:35:47,039 --> 00:35:48,519
It all stays in the same pot anyway.

721
00:35:48,760 --> 00:35:49,320
Right.

722
00:35:49,400 --> 00:35:50,679
Ever since I came here and met you,

723
00:35:50,679 --> 00:35:52,239
my luck has really turned around.

724
00:35:52,719 --> 00:35:54,880
The Taiwan, China MRI must arrive ASAP.

725
00:35:55,760 --> 00:35:58,039
It must be shipped by next month.

726
00:35:58,280 --> 00:35:59,599
I'll see to it right away.

727
00:36:00,360 --> 00:36:01,079
Understood.

728
00:36:01,079 --> 00:36:01,800
All right.

729
00:36:21,639 --> 00:36:22,920
Wouldn't it be nice to just make money?

730
00:36:23,480 --> 00:36:24,599
Why mess around like this every day?

731
00:37:24,920 --> 00:37:27,400
Spring thunder approaches; switch the contact.

732
00:37:27,760 --> 00:37:30,000
Antique Street may hold the miracle cure.

733
00:37:30,000 --> 00:37:32,519
A bracelet as proof; collect medicine tomorrow.

734
00:37:39,039 --> 00:37:39,960
It's an earthquake!

735
00:37:42,360 --> 00:37:43,000
Old Zhu!

736
00:37:44,000 --> 00:37:44,920
Zhu Yingjia!

737
00:37:46,000 --> 00:37:47,039
I'm taking a dump!

738
00:37:47,039 --> 00:37:48,199
What's all the shouting about?

739
00:37:48,199 --> 00:37:49,159
Come here quickly!

740
00:37:49,159 --> 00:37:50,400
Come look at this!

741
00:37:50,400 --> 00:37:52,679
...into the designated target area off Kaohsiung.

742
00:37:52,679 --> 00:37:54,159
Thus, since March 8th,

743
00:37:54,159 --> 00:37:55,559
when the "Joint 96" missile

744
00:37:55,559 --> 00:37:56,960
firing exercise began,

745
00:37:56,960 --> 00:37:58,400
the PLA has launched

746
00:37:58,400 --> 00:38:00,360
four Dongfeng-15 missiles.

747
00:38:00,360 --> 00:38:02,239
The previous three were launched from

748
00:38:02,239 --> 00:38:03,719
Yong'an and Nanping,

749
00:38:03,719 --> 00:38:04,920
two of which landed in

750
00:38:04,920 --> 00:38:06,679
the target area southwest of Kaohsiung,

751
00:38:06,679 --> 00:38:09,039
while one landed east of Keelung,

752
00:38:09,039 --> 00:38:10,119
in a target area about

753
00:38:10,119 --> 00:38:11,440
29 nautical miles from Keelung.

754
00:38:11,880 --> 00:38:13,519
The closest impact to Taiwan, China's coast

755
00:38:13,519 --> 00:38:14,880
was only tens of kilometers away.

756
00:38:15,239 --> 00:38:15,719
Yes.

757
00:38:16,960 --> 00:38:17,599
Yes.

758
00:38:19,639 --> 00:38:20,280
Understood.

759
00:38:23,559 --> 00:38:25,840
Zheng Guiping misses breakfast again.

760
00:38:26,880 --> 00:38:27,840
I didn't even get to finish my dump.

761
00:38:27,840 --> 00:38:28,800
Why does he get to eat?

762
00:38:28,960 --> 00:38:29,800
I'm skipping it too.

763
00:38:30,000 --> 00:38:30,840
Are there any steamed buns?

764
00:38:31,239 --> 00:38:32,119
Grab me two of them.

765
00:38:32,519 --> 00:38:33,159
Something to bite on the way.

766
00:38:33,400 --> 00:38:35,840
The missiles didn't hit the brass's homes.

767
00:38:36,199 --> 00:38:37,880
No matter the rush, one still has to eat.

768
00:38:38,239 --> 00:38:39,960
The higher-ups are breathing down our necks!

769
00:38:40,400 --> 00:38:42,159
Demanding meetings! Demanding intel!

770
00:38:42,599 --> 00:38:44,360
Even the US aircraft carriers are here.

771
00:38:44,840 --> 00:38:46,639
The mainland's Dongfeng-15 missiles

772
00:38:46,639 --> 00:38:48,760
were just 40 km from the city today.

773
00:38:48,760 --> 00:38:50,440
Will they hit Kaohsiung tomorrow?

774
00:38:55,519 --> 00:38:56,880
So you've decided what to say?

775
00:38:57,559 --> 00:38:59,119
Don't make promises you can't keep.

776
00:38:59,880 --> 00:39:01,199
Either way,

777
00:39:01,440 --> 00:39:02,679
I only hold two cards:

778
00:39:03,559 --> 00:39:05,679
Cao Liaoping's missile puzzle,

779
00:39:06,360 --> 00:39:07,800
and the mainland's military drill plan.

780
00:39:09,559 --> 00:39:11,679
Yang Shiwen's intel is quite accurate.

781
00:39:11,880 --> 00:39:13,000
It happened today, just like he said.

782
00:39:15,760 --> 00:39:17,800
I'm heading to Nangang this afternoon.

783
00:39:18,639 --> 00:39:20,280
A Canadian house-hunting tour is there.

784
00:39:20,280 --> 00:39:21,239
Are you coming?

785
00:39:23,280 --> 00:39:24,760
It won't be just me.

786
00:39:25,239 --> 00:39:26,519
The people sitting up front listening

787
00:39:26,519 --> 00:39:28,280
are all families of senior officials.

788
00:39:28,280 --> 00:39:29,639
Even they aren't hiding it.

789
00:39:30,280 --> 00:39:31,239
They even hand out boxed lunches at noon.

790
00:39:31,239 --> 00:39:33,000
What's the harm in taking a look?

791
00:39:34,920 --> 00:39:36,360
Tell Grandma to remember her medicine.

792
00:39:36,360 --> 00:39:37,119
Don't let her forget.

793
00:39:38,159 --> 00:39:38,719
I...

794
00:39:40,800 --> 00:39:42,800
Destination: Antique Street in the south.

795
00:39:42,800 --> 00:39:44,159
Comrades from relevant departments

796
00:39:44,159 --> 00:39:46,079
have been watching it for eight months.

797
00:39:46,280 --> 00:39:48,960
Much of the leaked classified intel lately

798
00:39:48,960 --> 00:39:50,880
was traded right here.

799
00:39:50,880 --> 00:39:52,199
Approved by bureau leadership,

800
00:39:52,199 --> 00:39:54,360
Division Two will take the lead today

801
00:39:54,360 --> 00:39:57,039
in a joint operation across four divisions.

802
00:39:57,039 --> 00:39:58,519
Everyone here is under my command now.

803
00:39:58,519 --> 00:40:00,519
I'll send you back after the mission.

804
00:40:00,639 --> 00:40:01,840
As for the arrest plan,

805
00:40:01,840 --> 00:40:04,039
everyone has been briefed.

806
00:40:04,039 --> 00:40:05,000
The key is speed:

807
00:40:05,000 --> 00:40:06,199
cast the net fast, pull it in fast.

808
00:40:06,199 --> 00:40:07,679
Don't let a single suspect slip away.

809
00:40:07,679 --> 00:40:09,719
The provincial and municipal bureaus are clear:

810
00:40:09,719 --> 00:40:11,960
since this is the prelude to Operation Spring Thunder,

811
00:40:12,280 --> 00:40:16,000
the main force should be vibrant young officers.

812
00:40:16,440 --> 00:40:17,320
A joint operation like this

813
00:40:17,320 --> 00:40:18,519
is the first one this year.

814
00:40:18,719 --> 00:40:20,000
Director Wu asked me to pass on a message:

815
00:40:20,280 --> 00:40:21,280
Safety comes first.

816
00:40:21,280 --> 00:40:22,360
Only by protecting yourselves

817
00:40:22,679 --> 00:40:23,840
can you strike at the enemy.

818
00:40:24,199 --> 00:40:25,360
Whether gathering intelligence

819
00:40:25,840 --> 00:40:26,719
or running reconnaissance,

820
00:40:27,159 --> 00:40:28,639
you must stay steady.

821
00:40:29,039 --> 00:40:30,920
The steadier you are, the more you win;

822
00:40:31,559 --> 00:40:33,199
the more rushed you are, the faster you lose.

823
00:40:33,400 --> 00:40:33,960
In short,

824
00:40:34,159 --> 00:40:35,280
we await your good news.

825
00:40:35,880 --> 00:40:36,400
Move out!

826
00:40:36,519 --> 00:40:37,079
Yes, sir!

827
00:40:41,559 --> 00:40:42,719
Brother Qi, why move all of a sudden?

828
00:40:42,719 --> 00:40:44,000
There was no advance notice.

829
00:40:44,360 --> 00:40:45,599
Next time, I'll tell Old Wei

830
00:40:45,599 --> 00:40:46,960
to submit a formal request to you first.

831
00:40:47,199 --> 00:40:48,440
We don't even know what we're going for.

832
00:40:48,440 --> 00:40:49,360
Only the location was given.

833
00:40:49,679 --> 00:40:51,760
Will we only get the details on site?

834
00:40:51,880 --> 00:40:52,800
That's for them.

835
00:40:52,800 --> 00:40:53,800
You're coming somewhere with me first.

836
00:40:54,719 --> 00:40:55,800
Where? To do what?

837
00:40:57,400 --> 00:40:58,079
Gamble.

838
00:41:01,920 --> 00:41:04,199
I've been here ever since I left the county.

839
00:41:04,440 --> 00:41:07,280
Passenger transit, freight, repairs, inspections—

840
00:41:07,360 --> 00:41:09,119
I've done everything that involves cars.

841
00:41:09,239 --> 00:41:10,920
I know these roads inside out.

842
00:41:10,920 --> 00:41:12,360
A good driver should be able

843
00:41:12,360 --> 00:41:13,719
to get you there with blindfolded eyes.

844
00:41:14,559 --> 00:41:16,079
I don't need any fancy stunts.

845
00:41:16,519 --> 00:41:17,280
Just watch the road.

846
00:41:20,639 --> 00:41:22,000
What about those friends of yours back then?

847
00:41:22,000 --> 00:41:22,920
What are they doing now?

848
00:41:22,920 --> 00:41:24,280
A bit of everything.

849
00:41:24,440 --> 00:41:25,880
Some work at photo studios,

850
00:41:25,880 --> 00:41:27,159
some opened small diners,

851
00:41:27,159 --> 00:41:28,679
and some are big bosses like you.

852
00:41:29,039 --> 00:41:30,119
Did anyone stay in the government?

853
00:41:30,119 --> 00:41:31,280
Definitely.

854
00:41:31,320 --> 00:41:32,639
But those who managed to stay

855
00:41:32,639 --> 00:41:34,199
surely found ways to climb the ladder.

856
00:41:34,199 --> 00:41:35,440
It's just a matter of pace.

857
00:41:35,559 --> 00:41:36,800
And how fast could they climb?

858
00:41:37,159 --> 00:41:39,440
Well, I heard one became a chief's secretary.

859
00:41:44,039 --> 00:41:45,079
Find some time

860
00:41:45,519 --> 00:41:47,119
and invite them out for a get-together.

861
00:41:47,880 --> 00:41:48,880
We're all good brothers.

862
00:41:49,039 --> 00:41:51,119
If there's an opportunity when we're together,

863
00:41:51,119 --> 00:41:52,679
to do some business and make money...

864
00:41:53,480 --> 00:41:54,360
No problem, boss.

865
00:41:54,360 --> 00:41:55,679
I'll give them a call in a bit.

866
00:41:59,400 --> 00:42:00,679
Multiple divisions mobilized at once...

867
00:42:00,679 --> 00:42:01,480
Such a massive operation...

868
00:42:01,480 --> 00:42:03,000
I've rarely seen anything like this.

869
00:42:03,079 --> 00:42:04,360
In such a complex operation,

870
00:42:04,519 --> 00:42:05,880
and me stopping you from gambling...

871
00:42:06,119 --> 00:42:07,519
There's so much behind this.

872
00:42:07,679 --> 00:42:09,599
Why aren't you pressing me today?

873
00:42:09,599 --> 00:42:11,480
You'll tell me when the time is right.

874
00:42:11,639 --> 00:42:12,360
I don't need to ask.

875
00:42:13,639 --> 00:42:15,320
Do you think today will go smoothly?

876
00:42:15,320 --> 00:42:16,320
You said it yourself:

877
00:42:16,320 --> 00:42:17,920
say something lucky before heading out.

878
00:42:17,920 --> 00:42:20,239
Believe you can do it, and you will.

879
00:42:36,320 --> 00:42:37,400
I'll wait for you here.

880
00:42:37,400 --> 00:42:38,840
Just call me if anything happens.

881
00:42:39,239 --> 00:42:40,320
You know your way around, huh?

882
00:42:40,599 --> 00:42:41,519
I've been here before.

883
00:42:42,360 --> 00:42:44,360
A friend took me to hunt for old cameras.

884
00:42:44,360 --> 00:42:45,760
They sell all sorts of things inside.

885
00:42:46,320 --> 00:42:47,400
Mahjong tiles from Taiwan, China,

886
00:42:47,400 --> 00:42:48,800
can be spent like cash in there.

887
00:42:49,199 --> 00:42:50,039
You wait here.

888
00:42:50,039 --> 00:42:50,679
Okay.

889
00:43:01,960 --> 00:43:03,159
What are you doing here?

890
00:43:08,239 --> 00:43:09,239
I'm Peng Yuchang,

891
00:43:09,239 --> 00:43:10,840
inviting you to watch the TV drama

892
00:43:10,840 --> 00:43:11,679
Confrontation.

893
00:43:11,880 --> 00:43:13,360
If I'd known you enjoyed this too,

894
00:43:13,360 --> 00:43:14,559
why bother going out to sing?

895
00:43:14,559 --> 00:43:15,719
Count me in! Count me in!

896
00:43:17,039 --> 00:43:17,920
Director Xiao.

897
00:43:17,920 --> 00:43:18,880
What a coincidence.

898
00:43:22,400 --> 00:43:22,960
Police! Gambling raid!

899
00:43:22,960 --> 00:43:23,400
Freeze!

900
00:43:23,400 --> 00:43:23,800
Nobody move!

901
00:43:23,800 --> 00:43:24,239
Stop right there!

902
00:43:24,559 --> 00:43:25,039
Get down!

903
00:43:25,239 --> 00:43:25,800
Don't move!

904
00:43:26,239 --> 00:43:28,159
We had no idea you were here.

905
00:43:28,280 --> 00:43:29,920
No one notified us beforehand.

906
00:43:29,920 --> 00:43:31,440
Then the one who paid and picked it up,

907
00:43:31,440 --> 00:43:32,639
why wasn't it Yang Shiwen?

908
00:43:32,800 --> 00:43:34,440
Who was it? Lin Kanshan.

909
00:43:35,440 --> 00:43:36,679
"The MIB?"

910
00:43:36,679 --> 00:43:38,000
They must be settling scores too.
